1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,006
Data satelit bisa mampir

2
00:00:02,006 --> 00:00:03,420
ke satelit lain.

3
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,826
Dua demonstrasi komunikasi yang didanai NASA

4
00:00:06,826 --> 00:00:08,974
diluncurkan pada dua puluh Oktober,

5
00:00:08,974 --> 00:00:11,550
menguji layanan relay komersial di orbit.

6
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:15,970
Jalur berkecepatan tinggi membawa data besar,

7
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:19,070
sedangkan jalur rendah membawa perintah

8
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:21,550
dan informasi pelacakan wahana.

9
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:25,350
Dalam demonstrasi, teknologi otonom direncanakan

10
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:28,450
merutekan data antara wahana Maxwell,

11
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:31,550
satelit relay, dan stasiun Bumi.

12
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:36,232
Sudah diluncurkan; kemampuan itu akan diuji.

13
00:00:36,232 --> 00:00:39,550
Jalur data antariksa ternyata berlapis-lapis.
